### 1. Create (expect 201)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/categories
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Food", "color": "#FF8800" }

### 2. List (expect 200)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/categories

### 3. Duplicate, different case (expect 409)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/categories
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "food" }

### 4. Invalid input (expect 400 with two details)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/categories
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "   ", "color": "orange" }

### 5. Rename (expect 200)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/categories/1
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Groceries", "color": "#00AA55" }

### 6. Not found (expect 404)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/categories/999
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "X" }

### 7. Delete (expect 204)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/v1/categories/1